OL,3,APassengers unlikely to be due
OL,4,Acompensation after air traffic control
OL,5,Aglitch, says regulator
OL,6,
OL,7,FThroughout the day, images have shown
OL,8,Fpassengers sleeping on airport floors,
OL,9,Fwith aviation analytics firm Cirium
OL,10,Fsaying more than 340 flights were
OL,11,Fcancelled today - around 5% of the
OL,12,Ftotal
OL,14,FNewlyweds Sasha and James say "it feels
OL,15,Flike we will spend our honeymoon at
OL,16,FGatwick", while one woman due to leave
OL,17,FTurkey on Tuesday is now stuck until
OL,18,FThursday
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
