OL,3,AOil hits $100 a barrel for first time
OL,4,Asince July after US and Houthi strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FOil prices rose to $100 (#74) a barrel
OL,7,Fon Wednesday, after the US and Iran
OL,8,Fattacked tankers in the Gulf region and
OL,9,FYemen's Houthis hit oil facilities in
OL,10,FSaudi Arabia.
OL,12,FOvernight, the US said it struck five
OL,13,FIranian tankers in retaliation for
OL,14,FIran's targeting of a warship, while
OL,15,FIran's Revolutionary Guards said they
OL,16,Fattacked eight tankers and two warships
OL,17,Fin response, as well as a US base in
OL,18,FJordan.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
