OL,3,AOil hits $100 a barrel for first time
OL,4,Asince July after US and Houthi strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Guards also said they planned a new
OL,7,F"prohibited zone" for shipping that
OL,8,Fextended beyond the Strait of Hormuz
OL,9,Finto the Arabian Sea.
OL,11,FThe Iran-backed Houthis reported dozens
OL,12,Fof Saudi strikes in Yemen, a day after
OL,13,Fdrone and missile attacks caused fires
OL,14,Fat several oil facilities in Saudi
OL,15,FArabia.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
